978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"秋日十咏 其六","author":"杨爵","text":"忽惊塞雁报清秋，困里帛书肯寄不。\n云外长风吹六翮，一飞千里到西周。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":28178,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"秋日十咏 其七","author":"杨爵","text":"寒蛬蚤已到幽床，梧叶枝头几个黄。\n清昼半阴云忽忽，几人能解此凄凉。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":28179,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"秋日十咏 其八","author":"杨爵","text":"绕塞西风白露天，万山黄叶落翩翩。\n穿窗日影无私照，一隙常来到卧边。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":28180,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"秋日十咏 其九","author":"杨爵","text":"五十余年人世事，此间白发几经秋。\n不知淫雨烟波上，谁去乘风泛柏舟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":28181,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"秋日十咏 其十","author":"杨爵","text":"看开宇宙谁人事，白昼天涯此日头。\n雁过故惊囚榻梦，一声凉夜送高秋。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":28182,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"秋夜同刘晴川观月 其一","author":"杨爵","text":"清光一片露云端，拱立圜阶心未阑。\n来岁今宵逢此月，恐无良友共相看。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":28183,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"秋夜同刘晴川观月 其二","author":"杨爵","text":"长空初夜静霏微，转步却将心事违。\n共说不妨幽户掩，隔窗点点是清辉。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":28184,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"秋夜同刘晴川观月 其三","author":"杨爵","text":"万古得天照宇寰，秋林辉色动燕山。\n疏窗半隙即全体，照到吾心方寸间。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":28185,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"秋燕","author":"杨爵","text":"辞社还寻高处藏，留予常系五云乡。\n时来时去天机在，羡尔一双羽翼长。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":28186,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送高大观年兄出狱用其留别韵","author":"杨爵","text":"别念关心泪欲流，送君出险我还留。\n要知今日嚬眉意，不是寻常生死愁。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":28187,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"丙午秋七月朔夜梦友人王泉冈张东台 其一","author":"杨爵","text":"总是髫年夙分投，神游万里自相求。\n不知吾友今宵梦，亦得须臾相遇不。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":28188,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"丙午秋七月朔夜梦友人王泉冈张东台 其二","author":"杨爵","text":"不断悬悬故旧情，梦中携手与同行。\n觉来展转增凄怆，门外铃声报五更。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":28189,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"丙午秋七月朔夜梦友人王泉冈张东台 其三","author":"杨爵","text":"暂合还离一旦情，郊原哭送我东行。\n年来忧患催人老，双鬓而今已变更。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":28190,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"丙午秋七月朔夜梦友人王泉冈张东台 其四","author":"杨爵","text":"去年送我出城东，转隔关山千万重。\n幽地此时空念切，只教梦里暂相逢。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":28191,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"答友人忽天章辽东作断事","author":"杨爵","text":"困里风霜几度侵，多君不替故人心。\n辽阳极目关河杳，读罢音书泪满襟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":28192,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"病中人有以诗喻使宽鄙怀者次其韵答之 其一","author":"杨爵","text":"数月言官耻素餐，杀身今日有何难。\n包荒自是男儿事，肯不同天一样宽。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":28193,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"病中人有以诗喻使宽鄙怀者次其韵答之 其二","author":"杨爵","text":"日午才将数粒餐，来之坎坎岂为难。\n眼中视此容身处，同彼霄壤无限宽。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":28194,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"春日十二首 其一","author":"杨爵","text":"乾坤无处不清明，伫立间看燕羽轻。\n一念孤怀酬圣主，百年人物此残生。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":28195,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"春日十二首 其二","author":"杨爵","text":"窗间舒日渐融融，曳杖逍遥百虑空。\n千古吾心谁乐与，首阳花草自春风。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":28196,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"春日十二首 其三","author":"杨爵","text":"雨霁春郊秀女萝，闲云偏惹落霞多。\n南鸿一羽冲寒峭，万里长空晚独过。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":28197,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"春日十二首 其四","author":"杨爵","text":"阳和到处总无垠，老干苍柯向月新。\n莫到幽囚空岁月，东风还有去年心。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":28198,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}}]